145,0 $_(128c) Earth Tongues _(Ascomycetes, Helotiales) These resemble their common name, usually a flattened fruiting body, sometimes without a distinct stalk. This order and similar looking species are discussed in A356-66; Ar865-78; M341-5; H $Earth Tongues
145,0 $a _(128c) Fruiting body with cap and stalk, cap convex; abrupt margin with sterile tissue below $Leotia and Ludonia
145,146 $b _(128c) Fruiting body lacking a distinct margin between sterile and fertile tissue
