166,0 $_(1L) Crust fungi _(dry) These are low-growing basidiomycete fruiting bodies _(typically on wood) whose spores are borne on pores or teeth. Some species are quite smooth and resemble paint, which can be cracked in a regular pattern. $Crust fungi
